  "description": "After a tragic loss, Hae-Seung will do whatever it takes to raise her nephew Ji-Un, even if it means pretending to be his biological mother. But her carefully built life begins to crumble when Tae-Ha, a cold and powerful corporate heir, demands custody of his late brother’s child. Unaware that Tae-Ha has already uncovered her secret through a covert DNA test, Hae-Seung agrees to a high-stakes marriage of convenience to keep Ji-Un by her side. But as their fake marriage gives way to real desire, Hae-Seung risks losing more than she ever imagined. Can their growing love survive the truth, or will Tae-Ha’s secret leverage tear their fragile family apart? \n\n(Source: WEBTOON)",
